                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Hyperlane was shipping a serious interoperability product with a marketing surface that still looked like a seed-round landing page. The ask: make the protocol legible to both validators and retail users without flattening the tech.",
