                  "fill": "$ink-60",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "We treated brand and product as one system: one type scale, one grid, one flame accent, shared components between the marketing site and the dashboard shell. That single decision cut handoff friction by half.",
